  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Disaster Tides — Innate Technique (11th level)</em></p><p>Starting at 11th level, with your studies you have learned how to condense the water that you create and use it as a ball of mass destruction. As an action for 6 Cursed Energy, you can choose one target within 30 feet of you. Make a cursed energy attack roll against it. On a hit, it will take 10d8 cold damage and be pushed 80 feet away from you. <br />\n You can instead as an action for 8 Cursed Energy choose a point within 30 feet of you. All creatures within a 10-foot radius circle of that point must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure they take 8d12 cold damage or half as much damage on a success. If the area is enclosed it is filled with 10 feet of water.</p>",
